       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. B045.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-IDX PIC 9 VALUE 2.
       01 WS-TABLE.
          05 WS-ITEM PIC X(4) OCCURS 3 TIMES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
       MOVE "RED" TO WS-ITEM(1).
       MOVE "BLU" TO WS-ITEM(2).
       IF WS-ITEM(WS-IDX) = "BLU"
          DISPLAY "INDEX-OK"
       ELSE
          DISPLAY "INDEX-NO"
       END-IF.
       STOP RUN.
